  triage:title "No boundary TOML exists for the new AsyncGraftReceiverEndpointStore trait" ;
  triage:description "PR #1261 added a new #[async_trait::async_trait] pub trait AsyncGraftReceiverEndpointStore in crates/atm-storage/src/contract.rs, mirroring the existing AsyncMessageStore trait. ruthless-boundary-qa found that unlike its AsyncMessageStore precedent (which has a recorded boundary declaration), this new trait has no corresponding entry in the boundaries/ TOML set, even though .just/lint_boundaries.py currently passes green despite the gap -- quality-mgr independently confirmed the lint doesn't catch this." ;
